From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 18:18:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove ai_onboarding crate (Zed AI / Zed Pro
 onboarding)

Deletes the ai_onboarding crate, which provided the "Welcome to Zed AI /
Sign in to try Zed Pro free" agent-panel onboarding card, the trial-end
upsell overlay, the young-account banner, and the edit-prediction
onboarding modal. All of it is Zed-Cloud subscription UX with no place in
a cloud-free fork.

Consumers updated: agent_panel.rs drops the onboarding/upsell fields,
render paths, and the now-unused user_store plan-gating; edit_prediction
drops onboarding_modal + its action handler; the inert Reset* action
type definitions remain (handlers gone). Full deletion, not stubbing, so
a future upstream reintroduction fails to compile.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
